# The models the GPU rental loads, and nothing else (doc/infra.md, GPU rental;
# ADR-0004 as amended 2026-10-22). Same format and rules as models.manifest —
# this line IS the licence record, a model with no line never runs — but kept
# apart because the home store fetches every line of models.manifest at each
# start, and these weights (~58 GB) only ever run on a rented CUDA card.
#
